    title: '“My body is indistinguishable from an elite athlete”: the twice-yearly MRI readout returns with 20s-equivalent fat and heart scores — self-reported scan impressions, a radiologist quote converted into a radiologist “report,” and the ACR still does not recommend whole-body MRI screening for asymptomatic people',
