    title: '“Your bedroom should be cold, dark and boring”: the feed’s highest-engagement post of the window is also its most evidence-aligned — the directive is a near-verbatim compression of stimulus control, the AASM-endorsed insomnia therapy whose core instruction is to keep the bedroom for sleep',
